1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,000
Coding agents make it easy to build a small iOS app just for yourself.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Free Personal Team development signing still expires.

3
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:17,000
SideRefresh makes renewal visible and repeatable.

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:24,000
For this demo, choose the checked-in SideRefresh Sample Xcode project

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:30,000
and one iPhone already paired and trusted in Xcode.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:38,000
After Apple setup, SideRefresh rebuilds local source,

7
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:45,000
asks Xcode to sign with your Personal Team, validates the result,
and reinstalls it on the paired iPhone.

8
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:52,000
The Simple workspace shows the latest verified install, signing expiration,
next refresh, connection method, and the one action needing attention.

9
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,000
Source stays on your Mac.
SideRefresh never asks for your Apple Account password.

10
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
It is open source, supports English and Korean,
and requires a Mac and Xcode.
